{"id":6093,"date":"2026-05-04T10:30:00","date_gmt":"2026-05-04T09:30:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=6093"},"modified":"2026-05-01T12:59:34","modified_gmt":"2026-05-01T11:59:34","slug":"create-your-own-wedding-website-the-ultimate-guide-for-couples-and-wedding-planners","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/create-your-own-wedding-website-the-ultimate-guide-for-couples-and-wedding-planners\/","title":{"rendered":"Create Your Own Wedding Website? The ultimate guide for couples and wedding planners."},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">A wedding is one of the most beautiful events of your life. For couples, it is the day of their dreams; for wedding planners, it is the chance to make a dream a reality down to the smallest detail.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">You have only one thing in common: there is an incredible amount to arrange. And that is exactly where a wedding website comes in. <\/font><\/font><br><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">While it used to be a nice extra, nowadays a wedding website is incredibly handy to have. A place where everything comes together, from practical information to memories for later!<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:75px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">1. Start with a strong first impression<\/font><\/font><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">In the wedding industry, everything revolves around a certain feeling. The atmosphere, the look and feel, and the trust must be right from the start. Your website plays a major role in this.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">For couples, it is an extension of your wedding invitation. The moment guests visit your website, they should immediately feel the style and atmosphere of your day. With your own domain name, you keep everything sleek and personal.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">It works the same way for wedding planners. Your website is often the first point of contact with potential clients. A professional appearance and your own domain name show that you are serious about what you do. It inspires confidence, and that is exactly what people are looking for when they entrust their wedding to someone.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2. Make it easy for yourself (and your guests)!<\/font><\/font><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Organizing a wedding often brings with it endless questions. Who is coming? Are there any dietary requirements? What about the schedule? With a wedding website, you take a large part of that communication off your hands:<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Online RSVP:<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> With our <\/font><\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426716274321-Add-a-form\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Form Element,<\/font><\/font><\/a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> you can easily add an RSVP field. Guests can directly indicate via your website whether they are attending, who their plus one is, and whether there are any allergies. This way, you have all the data clearly organized.<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Gift list<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : Create a separate page where you post your gift suggestions, or place a <\/font><\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426732355601-Generate-a-QR-code-for-your-website\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">QR code<\/font><\/font><\/a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> that links to a gift list.<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Privacy<\/font><\/font><\/strong><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> : A website is ideal for sharing practical information such as your location, parking options, and the day&#8217;s schedule. Would you prefer the day&#8217;s schedule or location not to be visible to the whole world? Then you can easily <\/font><\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426733603985-Password-protect-a-page\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">protect the pages with a password.<\/font><\/font><\/a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> This way, only invited guests see the protected page.<\/font><\/font><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">3. Become the wedding expert in your region (especially for wedding planners)<\/font><\/font><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">For wedding planners, a website is not only a business card but also a key growth engine. <\/font><\/font><br><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Many couples begin their search online. For example, they search for <\/font><\/font><em><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">\u201cwedding planner in New York\u201d<\/font><\/font><\/em><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> or <\/font><\/font><em><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">\u201corganize wedding Cambridge\u201d.<\/font><\/font><\/em><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> If your website is well-designed, you can be visible at exactly that moment.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By making smart use of SEO (search engine optimization), you increase your chances of being found on Google. Consider incorporating your region and specialization into your page titles and text.<br>With Webador, you can easily set this up without technical knowledge. This way, you build your online visibility step by step and attract exactly the right customers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tip: Check out our <\/font><\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">help center<\/font><\/font><\/a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> for more SEO tips<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">4. Mobile First: Information at Your Fingertips<\/font><\/font><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Chances are your website is viewed primarily on mobile. Guests quickly check the location, schedule, or address. Therefore, it is important that your website looks good and is easy to use on mobile as well.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All Webador designs are responsive. This means that your website automatically adjusts to the size of the screen on which it is viewed. However, it is still smart to check for yourself how your website looks on mobile. You can easily switch to the mobile view in the editor.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Do you want to make it extra user-friendly? Then you can add a <\/font><\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/help.webador.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/29426735850513-Add-a-mobile-bar\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">mobile bar<\/font><\/font><\/a><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"> with important information such as contact details or the location.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"530\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Screenshot-2026-05-01-134449-1024x530.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6095\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Screenshot-2026-05-01-134449-1024x530.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Screenshot-2026-05-01-134449-300x155.png 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Screenshot-2026-05-01-134449-768x397.png 768w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Screenshot-2026-05-01-134449-1536x795.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Screenshot-2026-05-01-134449.png 1728w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">5. From informative website to a lasting memory<\/font><\/font><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">The beauty of a wedding website is that it doesn&#8217;t stop after the big day. In fact, after the vows, your website gets a second life.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">For wedding couples, it is the perfect place to collect memories. Think of a photo gallery where guests can view the images from the day. You can also add a download link via the button element, so that everyone can easily save the photos.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">For wedding planners, this is the moment to showcase your work. Create a page with Case Studies and create a separate subpage for each wedding where you post beautiful photos and a review from the couple. This gives potential clients not only inspiration but also confidence!<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:75px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Your wedding starts online<\/font><\/font><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Whether you are organizing a wedding or taking care of one down to the last detail: a website is essential. <\/font><\/font><br><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font dir=\"auto\" style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">With Webador, you can easily create a wedding website that matches your style, without technical knowledge and with all the features you need.<\/font><\/font><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on